            <description><![CDATA[<h2>RestinPID 3.7</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>New icon:</b> a tombstone whose top is a restart arrow, with a heartbeat inside. It replaces the app icon and the menu bar icon.</li>
<li><b>Easier to spot when an app stops responding:</b> the menu bar icon becomes a solid red tombstone with a "!" and a count of frozen apps, a glow pulses behind it, and it jiggles until you open the panel.</li>
<li>The warning no longer turns black: it now stays visible on black, white and every menu bar in between.</li>
<li><b>Settings → Alerts:</b> choose the colour, solid or outline, the count, icon size, glow speed, and jiggle strength and timing. Previews show the icon on black, grey and white menu bars, and a button shows it in your menu bar.</li>
<li>With Reduce Motion on in System Settings, the glow holds steady and nothing moves.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
